{
  "title": "logrotate -f 强制轮转实测",
  "lines": [
    {"t": "note", "s": "logrotate 3.22.0，配置与正文一致"},
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "logrotate -f /etc/logrotate.d/nginx && echo \"logrotate rc=0\""},
    {"t": "out", "s": "logrotate rc=0"},
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "ls -l /apps/openresty/nginx/logs/head/ | grep access"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "-rw-r----- 1 nginx qhdrsj 0 ... access.log"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 196 ... access.log.1"},
    {"t": "note", "s": "delaycompress：.1 暂不压缩；640 权限生效"},
    {"t": "note", "s": "USR1 重开后属主按 worker 用户改写（nginx:qhdrsj）"},
    {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx/1.31.5 容器 (logrotate 3.22.0)"}
  ]
}
